  - "You\u2019d think so, also no I didn\u2019t fall for any like \u201Can old geezer\u201C."
  part2s:
  - Apparently some people are forgetful, or something. Your overconfidence is killing
    me too, don't act too confident!
  part3s:
  - "I did fall for atleast one, but I am no \u201Cold geezer\u201D, as you say.
    Also maybe the supervisor had other things on their mind?"
